'''Steel Tennis''' (鋼式テニス, ''Kōshiki Tenisu'', '''Steel Tennis''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Speed UP (M): Cats' movement speed increases by 15%.

==Requirement==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Steel Tennis|Unit Speed Up (M)|Tekachi|Racquet Cat|jpname=鋼式テニス}}
}}

==Trivia==
*This Combo's Japanese name is a pun on 硬式テニス (''kōshiki tenisu''), a name for tennis as opposed to 軟式テニス (''nanshiki tenisu'', [[wikipedia:Soft tennis|soft tennis]]), with the kanji 硬 (hard) replaced by 鋼 (steel).

